  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Blazing Courage — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level you have learned to expand your domain. Any melee weapon you are holding is treated as having the maximum cursed energy used for <em>Ignition</em> and is imbued with your domain’s guaranteed hit. At initiative 20, all creatures of your choice within your domain suffer the damage of your <em>Mantle of Courage</em>.</p>",
